Package: MooseR
Title: Data Cleaning and Summary Utility Functions
Version: 0.0.0.9047
Authors@R: c(
    person("MooseWeb3", email = "develop@mooseweb3.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("MissV", email = "v@vthelab.com", role = "ctb")
  )
Description: A collection of utility functions for common data wrangling tasks,
    including column name cleaning, duplicate detection, uniqueness checks,
    quote removal, one-row summary tables for categorical and continuous variables,
    covariate balance comparison, stable de-identified ID generation, date helpers,
    and personal-name detection and masking with spaCy or a pure R regex fallback.
